      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹36.40 (up from ₹8.31 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹6.93b (up 12% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹551.7m (up 338% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 8.0% (up from 2.0% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 21% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
